BEGIN IMMEDIATE;

-- v0.32 adds long-form stories: twelve full retellings of 12-20 sections
-- each, told section by section in the order of a located public witness.
-- Every section has its own anchor claim with evidence at the same locator.
-- Long versions of existing stories take version_order 0 so they open first;
-- the earlier short versions stay unchanged beside them. Ming novels and
-- Plutarch stay in LATER_RECEPTION; Tablet XII of Gilgamesh, Book VII of the
-- Rāmāyaṇa and the passages Plutarch himself omits are not retold.

