('creature.greek.hecatoncheires','HUNDRED_HANDED_GIANTS','{}','["hurl three hundred rocks at once"]','[]',NULL,'Sons of Gaia and Ouranos, bound beneath the earth by their father.','Guard the Titans in Tartarus after the war.'),
