UPDATE entities SET description='《封神演义》中裹着初生哪吒的红绫；在河里一摆，就震动了龙宫。 / Red silk sash around the newborn Nezha in Investiture of the Gods; swished in the river, it shakes the Dragon King''s palace.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='artifact.chinese.huntian_ling' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='太阳神，保护吉尔伽美什，派十三阵风制住胡姆巴巴。 / Sun god who protects Gilgamesh and sends thirteen winds against Humbaba.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.akkadian.shamash' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='原初的甜水，与提亚马特生出众神，在《埃努玛·埃利什》第一块泥板中被埃阿杀死。 / Primordial fresh water and begetter of the gods with Tiamat, slain by Ea in Enūma eliš I.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.babylonian.apsu' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='智慧之神；杀死阿普苏，生下马尔杜克，用金古的血造人（《埃努玛·埃利什》）。 / Wise god who slays Apsû, fathers Marduk and creates humankind from Qingu''s blood (Enūma eliš).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.babylonian.ea' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='提亚马特军队的统帅，持有命运泥板；人类用他的血造成。 / Tiamat''s champion holding the Tablet of Destinies; humankind is made from his blood.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.babylonian.kingu' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='明代小说中的东海龙王：孙悟空从他的龙宫取走金箍棒，哪吒打死他的三太子。 / Dragon King of the Eastern Sea in Ming novels; Sun Wukong takes the Golden-Hooped Rod from his palace and Nezha kills his third son.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.chinese.ao_guang' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='灌江口显圣二郎真君；《西游记》第六回与孙悟空斗变化并将其擒获。 / The Illustrious Sage Erlang of Guanjiang, whose contest of transformations with Sun Wukong is told in Journey to the West ch. 6.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.chinese.erlang_shen' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='中国民间信仰中的天庭之主；《西游记》中先封孙悟空为弼马温、齐天大圣，后请二郎神与如来降服他。 / Ruler of heaven in Chinese popular religion; in Journey to the West he grants Sun Wukong offices, then calls on Erlang and Rulai to subdue him.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.chinese.jade_emperor' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='《封神演义》中的陈塘关总兵、哪吒之父；用燃灯道人所赐玲珑宝塔降服哪吒，得名“托塔天王”。 / Commander of Chentang Pass and Nezha''s father in Investiture of the Gods; the golden pagoda that subdues Nezha gives him the title Pagoda-Bearing Heavenly King.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.chinese.li_jing' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='《西游记》中的如来佛祖：与孙悟空打赌，把他压在五行山下（小说人物，不涉及教义与历史判断）。 / Rulai as a character of Journey to the West, who wins the palm wager and pins Sun Wukong under the Mountain of Five Elements.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.chinese.rulai_xiyouji' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='被神化的老子；《西游记》中金丹被孙悟空偷吃，又把孙悟空放进八卦炉锻炼。 / Deified Laozi; in Journey to the West his elixir is eaten by Sun Wukong, whom he refines in the Eight Trigrams furnace.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.chinese.taishang_laojun' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='书写与计算之神，常作朱鹭首或狒狒形；普鲁塔克称他为赫尔墨斯，说他从月亮那里赢来五个闰日。 / Ibis- or baboon-headed god of writing and reckoning; Plutarch, calling him Hermes, says he won the five epagomenal days from the Moon.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.egyptian.thoth' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='伊阿佩托斯之子；在墨科涅分肉时欺骗宙斯，用茴香秆盗火，被锁住直到赫拉克勒斯解救（《神谱》第507–616行）。 / Son of Iapetus who tricks Zeus at Mecone and steals fire in a fennel stalk, and is chained until Heracles frees him (Theogony 507–616).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.greek.prometheus' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='奥丁之子；骑斯莱布尼尔九夜前往冥界，请求放回巴德尔（《欺骗古鲁菲》第49章）。 / Odin''s son who rides Sleipnir nine nights to Hel to ask for Baldr''s return (Gylfaginning 49).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.norse.hermod' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='盲眼之神；在洛基的指引下把槲寄生投向巴德尔（《欺骗古鲁菲》第49章）。 / Blind god who throws the mistletoe at Baldr on Loki''s direction (Gylfaginning 49).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.norse.hodr' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='巴德尔之妻，在丈夫的葬礼上心碎而死（《欺骗古鲁菲》第49章）。 / Baldr''s wife, whose heart breaks at his funeral (Gylfaginning 49).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.norse.nanna_nepsdottir' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='洛基之妻，用碗接住毒蛇滴下的毒液（《欺骗古鲁菲》第50章）。 / Loki''s wife, who catches the serpent''s venom in a bowl (Gylfaginning 50).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.norse.sigyn' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='巨人出身的女神；把毒蛇挂在被缚的洛基上方（《欺骗古鲁菲》第50章）。 / Giant-born goddess who hangs the venomous snake above the bound Loki (Gylfaginning 50).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.norse.skadi' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='伊南娜的丈夫，被交给恶魔作为她的替身；乌图把他的手脚变成蛇的手脚。 / Inana''s husband, handed to the demons as her substitute; Utu turns his hands and feet into a snake''s.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.sumerian.dumuzi' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='伊南娜忠实的大臣，求得恩基相救，并被免于交给恶魔。 / Inana''s faithful minister, who seeks Enki''s help and is spared from the demons.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='deity.sumerian.ninshubur' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='用泥土造出、与吉尔伽美什相匹敌的野人；他们的友谊与他的死贯穿标准巴比伦版史诗。 / Wild man made from clay as Gilgamesh''s equal; his friendship with Gilgamesh and his death drive the Standard Babylonian epic.',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='hero.mesopotamian.enkidu' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');
UPDATE entities SET description='大洪水的幸存者，被众神赐予永生，向吉尔伽美什讲述大洪水（第十一块泥板）。 / Survivor of the Flood granted eternal life, who tells Gilgamesh the Flood story (Tablet XI).',updated_at='2026-10-11T01:00:00Z' WHERE id='hero.mesopotamian.utnapishtim' AND (description IS NULL OR description='');

